<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 14431 0 R/Alt(Two side-by-side panels against a=k lambda_De from 0.12 to 0.6. Left: real frequency of the exact Maxwellian Langmuir root and the Bohm-Gross asymptote; they agree for small a and separate beyond about 0.25. Right: damping rate of the exact root and the weak-damping asymptote; both are negligible below a of about 0.2, the asymptote overestimates near 0.3 and saturates, while the exact rate keeps growing.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[21 22]/Pg 17944 0 R>>
endobj
